    "body": "Hmm, I see. I'm re-reading the es-discuss thread now. I guess we can try to to deal with this ourselves. I still can't see what the problems are with letting ModuleDeclarationInstantiation complete successfully the second time, but I guess you found some in fuzz testing?\n",
