    "created_at": "2016-07-13T16:51:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-13T16:51:32Z",
    "body": "If you have any ideas on how you are going to implement this, or how it could be specced, I'd appreciate them. Right now it looks quite hard to do with the current spec setup. In particular there's no real easy way to find out which entries in the module map need to get nulled out.\n\nI guess the closest I have is looping through the tree of [[RequestedModules]], using \"resolve a module specifier\" to get to the module map key, and then nulling it out from there after all the relevant keys are collected?\n",
