    "created_at": "2016-07-22T17:53:55Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-22T17:53:55Z",
    "body": "@jonco3 do you have a good understanding of the conclusion of the es-discuss thread, and how to possibly integrate it into the spec's model?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
